<title>FINLAND: NESTE TO SUPPLY SOLAR SYSTEMS TO MONGOLIA.</title>
<headline>NESTE TO SUPPLY SOLAR SYSTEMS TO MONGOLIA.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish state-controlled oil and chemicals group Neste Oy said on Monday it had won a solar power unit order worth about 12 million markka from the Post and Telecommunication Authority (PTA) of Mongolia.</p>
<p>&quot;The deal strengthens Neste Advanced Power Systems' (NAPS) position as one of the leading solar electricity systems suppliers for data applications in Asia,&quot; Neste said in a statement.</p>
</text>
